OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge and two more arrests
OL,4,Aover teen death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder and attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fteenager was killed and another
OL,9,Fseriously injured in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,11,FPolice were called to Brookhouse Road
OL,12,Fin Meir at 23:45 BST on Friday where a
OL,13,Fman in his late teens was pronounced
OL,14,Fdead at the scene.
OL,16,FTwo more teens, a 19-year-old man and a
OL,17,F16-year-old boy, have been arrested
OL,18,Fover the incident - both on suspicion
OL,19,Fof murder and attempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
